@startuml
left to right direction
node "Employee workstation / JVM" as client {
 artifact "client-swing.jar" as swing
 artifact "common-dto.jar" as c1
}
node "Application host / independent JVM" as backend {
 artifact "backend-server.jar" as api
 artifact "common-dto.jar" as c2
 artifact "Microsoft JDBC driver" as jdbc
}
node "Database host" as data {
 database "Microsoft SQL Server\ndm schema v1 + migration v2" as sql
}
swing --> api : HTTPS / JSON / bearer
api --> jdbc : JDBC
jdbc --> sql : SQL Server TCP + TLS
note bottom of client
No JDBC / SQL credentials in desktop
end note
note bottom of data
Real SQL Server deployment NOT executed here
end note
@enduml
